                                "sense_id": "69d61118-9169-364d-9d7f-0994262a3fe9",
                                "text": "– Vous comprenez, disait-il au serrurier, c’est pour une chambre de jeune fille : ces écervelées égarent la clé et il faut pour la retenir quelque chose de solide, une grosse chaîne persuasive, assez gracieuse pourtant, n’est-ce pas ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0de8a89a-dd01-4c30-8755-a1a1b62925a3",
                                "sense_id": "69d61118-9169-364d-9d7f-0994262a3fe9",
                                "text": "Ni la vieille schnoque au chignon grisaillant entortillé par-dessus son austère visage rebutant de gouvernante acariâtre, ni la jeune écervelée qui se prenait pour le nombril du monde, n'entendait lâcher prise, jamais."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c0bf5913-8ea3-4dc4-b752-a8bd576e95f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "6efcf360-da47-3a76-93cd-c6a2899d036d",
                        "source_sense_id": "69d61118-9169-364d-9d7f-0994262a3fe9",
                        "target_lang_word": "Luftikus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Luftikus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff53a37d-a84b-3cf0-9137-153b2ed082d7",
                                        "entry_id": "a59b170e-330c-30bc-a019-fb7051dda46e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der sich durch Leichtsinn und Unzuverlässigkeit auszeichnet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8a32f03-b1e8-4d77-ac8c-68573ea1ff73",
                                                "sense_id": "ff53a37d-a84b-3cf0-9137-153b2ed082d7",
                                                "text": "In dieser Angelegenheit hat sich Hein nicht zum ersten Mal als echter Luftikus erwiesen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2b7fce2-ddfc-483b-a2e6-d9f30042e57a",
                                                "sense_id": "ff53a37d-a84b-3cf0-9137-153b2ed082d7",
                                                "text": "„Bis in die zwanziger Jahre galt Franklin D. Roosevelt in weiten Kreisen als fröhlicher Luftikus mit nicht allzu großem Sachverstand- obwohl er von 1913 bis 1919 Staatssekretär im Marineministerium gewesen war.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c12c38f5-d787-4804-9a8a-719225e38671",
                                                "sense_id": "ff53a37d-a84b-3cf0-9137-153b2ed082d7",
                                                "text": "„Sehr anständig hat sich dieser Herr Pagel kaum benommen, und es ist nur gut, so ein Luftikus merkt mal, man sieht ihm auf die Finger.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2149c44-1aef-4021-8ebb-7252d4b0a4b7",
                                                "sense_id": "ff53a37d-a84b-3cf0-9137-153b2ed082d7",
                                                "text": "„Nie war ich Spieler, nie einer, der ohne Strapazen davonkam. Nie Luftikus, der tänzelte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2cfd4d00-e3a4-4659-a918-d50d5a87c37a",
                        "source_entry_id": "6efcf360-da47-3a76-93cd-c6a2899d036d",
                        "source_sense_id": "69d61118-9169-364d-9d7f-0994262a3fe9",
                        "target_lang_word": "brainless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "brainless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba511a9a-9b03-3f99-bf6c-dbdbff8e4b44",
                                        "entry_id": "7581ed4b-a231-32cf-bcea-988ac8f8ce49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having no brain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "921d9c55-e8a0-43f4-8439-6554d1988eb2",
                                                "sense_id": "ba511a9a-9b03-3f99-bf6c-dbdbff8e4b44",
                                                "text": "Surely it was more likely that a brainless creature, acting solely by vague predatory instinct, would give up the chase when I disappeared, and, after a pause of astonishment, would wander away in search of some other prey?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a481fe89-faa1-3ce7-908c-4937ef6b4339",
                                        "entry_id": "7581ed4b-a231-32cf-bcea-988ac8f8ce49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unintelligent, with little common sense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "831d9a22-1bd4-4144-a0b1-7155be9390a3",
                                                "sense_id": "a481fe89-faa1-3ce7-908c-4937ef6b4339",
                                                "text": "\"I don't mean all of your friends—only a small proportion—which, however, connects your circle with that deadly, idle, brainless bunch—the insolent chatterers at the opera, the gorged dowagers, the worn-out, passionless men, the enervated matrons of the summer capital,[…]!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03af9c0c-6f9b-3422-b3ac-01ee6bf66b24",
                                        "entry_id": "7581ed4b-a231-32cf-bcea-988ac8f8ce49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Overly repetitive and unchallenging, not requiring any careful attention or providing any significant stimulation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a thing done"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd5815fb-1cdc-4fc5-8a60-96a025c5111f",
                                                "sense_id": "03af9c0c-6f9b-3422-b3ac-01ee6bf66b24",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: automatic, rote, dull"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
